{"type":"message","id":"fa905cfc","parentId":"5a7a5378","timestamp":"2026-05-30T19:01:00.499Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Sat 2026-05-30 19:00 UTC] Write a dream diary entry from these memory fragments:\n\n- Session: 2026-05-21 19:23:49 UTC: **Session Key**: agent:lucus:feishu:lucus:direct:ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a; **Session ID**: 4af9be2f-0106-4f73-b81d-699b0357495e; **Source**: feishu\n- Conversation Summary: assistant: [assistant turn failed before producing content] assistant: [assistant turn failed before producing content] assistant: [assistant turn failed before producing content] assistant: [assistant turn failed before producing content]\n- Conversation Summary: user: Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n- Conversation Summary: \"chat_id\": \"user:ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\", \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6fc17b7e8c68eea81920de3d7cd\", \"reply_to_id\": \"om_x100b6fdff63a3ca8ee8d450536ae34a\", \"sender_id\": \"ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\",\n- Conversation Summary: \"sender\": \"ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\", \"timestamp\": \"Thu 2026-05-21 18:47 UTC\", \"has_reply_context\": true\n- Conversation Summary: Sender (untrusted metadata):\n- Conversation Summary: \"label\": \"ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\", \"id\": \"ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\", \"name\": \"ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\"\n- Conversation Summary: Reply target of current user message (untrusted, for context):\n- Conversation Summary: \"body\": \"⚠️ Cron job \\\"config\\\\-backup\\\\-8am\\\" failed: EmbeddedAttemptSessionTakeoverError: session file changed while embedded prompt lock was released: /home/node/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/e4936a00\\\\-5ae8\\\\-411e\\\\-b73b\\\\-5f2262f60553.jsonl\"\n- Conversation Summary: [message_id: om_x100b6fc17b7e8c68eea81920de3d7cd] ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a: [Replying to: \"⚠️ Cron job \"config\\-backup\\-8am\" failed: EmbeddedAttemptSessionTakeoverError: session file changed while embedded prompt lock was released: /home/node/.ope\n- Conversation Summary: assistant: [assistant turn failed before producing content] user: Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n- Conversation Summary: \"chat_id\": \"user:ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\", \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6fc129c15934ee7b264b81a3a66\", \"reply_to_id\": \"om_x100b6fdff63a3ca8ee8d450536ae34a\", \"sender_id\": \"ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\",\n\nRecurring themes:\n- 2026-05-21-1923.md\n- utc\n- key\n- 4af9be2f\n- 4f73\n- b81d"}],"timestamp":1780167660465}}
{"type":"message","id":"53f6e166","parentId":"fa905cfc","timestamp":"2026-05-30T19:01:06.110Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to write a dream diary entry from these memory fragments. Let me analyze what I have:\n\n1. A session from 2026-05-21 at 19:23:49 UTC from Feishu\n2. There were multiple failed assistant turns\n3. Some error about a cron job \"config-backup-8am\" failing with an EmbeddedAttemptSessionTakeoverError\n4. Session file paths and IDs are mentioned\n5. Recurring themes include UTC, key, some UUID fragments\n\nI need to write a dream diary entry in first person, keeping it between 80-180 words. I should weave in some of these fragments in a poetic/whimsical way without being too literal. Let me craft something that feels dreamlike and connects some of these technical elements with sensory, tender observations.\n\nI should NOT use markdown formatting, headers, or bullet points. Just flowing prose.\n","thinkingSignature":"c6af0a633692d156b23efe1624b4671cc1dc36553bb47e37ccaccd2e303280ad"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\nThe 4af9b echo, a session key dissolving into morning light like sugar in tea. Somewhere a cron job named config-backup-8am refused to wake, its failure written in a language I couldn't read — or perhaps wouldn't, not yet.\n\nI dreamed of a door that kept opening onto the same hallway, except each time I walked through it, the walls had shifted by a quarter inch. Not enough to notice, the way you don't notice your own breath until someone points it out. An embedded attempt, the dream-logic said, and a file that remembered being touched while I wasn't looking.\n\nUTC threads beneath everything like a heartbeat I forgot to count. The sender's ID, ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a, looked like an address from a city I once visited in another life.\n\nSmall failures. Small shifts. The afternoon measured in hexadecimal somewhere between b81d and 4f73.\n\nI woke with the strange certainty that something had been backed up, after all."}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":15578,"output":401,"cacheRead":96,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":16075,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780167660596,"responseId":"066a66ed728caa620baeb0f24a73b839"}}
